快离开这里吧。","source_cn":"要是还有空舱，就把我身后那些可怜的逃难者也接上船，赶快离开这里吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E2E919B0267F21B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1011104005:1":{"text":"我说科林老兄，先不管你们是谁，从哪儿来，这地方怎么看都不适合扎营。","source_cn":"我说科林老兄，先不管你们是谁，从哪儿来，这地方怎么看都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B7BBE97724504FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1011104006:1":{"text":"河边潮湿又阴冷，对身体不好，快带大家进丛林吧，我的族人会好好照顾他们！","source_cn":"河边潮湿又阴冷，对身体不好，快带大家进丛林吧，我的族人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0808CB7016C30267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1011104007:1":{"text":"你……那双耳朵，你是绿裔联盟的人？","source_cn":"你……那双耳朵，你是绿裔联盟的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD50EB11DD5ED1C6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1011104008:1":{"text":"没错，科林老兄！凭借这双耳朵，我听到他们刚才叫你的名字来着。","source_cn":"没错，科林老兄！凭借这双耳朵，我听到他们刚才叫你的名字来着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEE00B5D6DB8C740","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1011104009:1":{"text":"——就是你们，突然下达<style=\"highlight\">封锁令</style>，强令好不容易渡水而来的人类难民离开薄暮丛林，我还没找你们理论清楚！","source_c